0.000 0.000 0.000 setrgbcolor AdjustColor
0 31 537 [
[(The first inlet is a number to add or delete. If the second inlet is)]
[(nonzero, the number is added to the collection, otherwise it is)]
[(removed. A list can also be given, which distributes the values into)]
[(the inlets as usual in Pd.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
grestore
gsave
/Menlo-Regular findfont 12 scalefont ISOEncode setfont
0.000 0.000 0.000 setrgbcolor AdjustColor
0 31 471 [
[(By default, the collection may have many copies of the same number,)]
[(but if set to unique mode \050via the "unique" message or "-u" flag\051,)]
[(duplicates are dropped and a "bang" is sent out the second outlet.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
grestore
gsave
/Menlo-Regular findfont 12 scalefont ISOEncode setfont
0.000 0.000 0.000 setrgbcolor AdjustColor
0 31 421 [
[(You can output the collection with a bang, output and empty it with a)]
[("flush" message, or just empty it with "clear".)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
grestore
gsave
/Menlo-Regular findfont 12 scalefont ISOEncode setfont
0.000 0.000 0.000 setrgbcolor AdjustColor
0 301 216 [
[(set or clear "unique" flag. A)]
[(bang is set to the right outlet)]
[(when there's a repeated input.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
grestore
