/Menlo-Regular findfont 12 scalefont ISOEncode setfont
0.000 0.000 0.000 setrgbcolor AdjustColor
0 31 585 [
[(The [bag] object maintains a variable-length collection of numbers,)]
[(for instance to implement a MIDI-style sustain pedal or an)]
[(arpeggiator.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
